%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: a link with a named destination across pages. Page 1
% defines the destination top; page 2 carries a link to it whose
% rectangle is given under a scale of two, so the annotation's
% rectangle in the document is the scaled one, 20 20 100 40, and its
% destination resolves through the catalog's named destinations to
% page 1.
[ /Dest /top /View [/Fit] /DEST pdfmark
72 700 moveto 300 700 lineto stroke
showpage
2 2 scale
[ /Rect [10 10 50 20] /Dest /top /Subtype /Link /ANN pdfmark
10 10 moveto 50 10 lineto stroke
showpage
